{"c":[{"id":"2925274083aef64a","sum":"SC1: exclude.ts high-entropy counts lower/upper/digit only (symbols broke B25 held-16); excluded values read in as [withheld]. Request text is ModelText only (own/t/descriptor/candidate/memoryText, derived for reformats); casts outside src/privacy/ fail sc1-boundary.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T200650Z-ffcd5d83b2f9fc55","text":"SC1 exclude.ts: the high-entropy rule counts only lower/upper/digit classes; counting symbols flagged corpus URL paths (51310/forms/greenhouse-apply) and broke B25 held-16. Excluded values become [withheld] at read-in; writes and memory refuse any text holding it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T211138Z-929a7c53a65ffe04","text":"SC1: request text compiles only as ModelText (privacy/disclosure.ts own/t/descriptor/candidate/memoryText); mint a reformatted value with derived(base, text), which refuses words the screen never showed. A ModelText cast outside src/privacy/ fails test/sc1-boundary.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"6af8d35d2cbd1bc9","sum":"Field-format candidates carry fieldFormat provenance and assumptions through both verifier wordings; validation traces the mint to its window source. Every request slot needs a privacy/shapes.ts row, or verify throws OutOfShape; purpose-less requests carry own() only.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T213034Z-ef7ccd2a17aa97dd","text":"Field-format fill candidates carry fieldFormat provenance and conversion assumptions through both verifier wordings; planner validation traces a genuine mint to its original window source and rechecks provenance, since formatted text need not occur verbatim.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T215427Z-85a4a1e31491fed7","text":"Every request slot needs a row in helper/src/privacy/shapes.ts: Disclosure.verify throws OutOfShape for a path with no row, a mint reason the row disallows, or text over its max; a request with no purpose may carry only own() wording.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
